<title>UK: Provident Financial H1 pretax rises 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Provident Financial H1 pretax rises 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>half year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.8		   vs 10.25</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.5		    vs 5.5</p>
<p> Op profit and pretax   47.5		   vs 41.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   209.7		  vs 219.6</p>
<p>NOTE - UK personal finance services group Provident Financial Plc said it expected to report &quot;a good result&quot; for the year as a whole.</p>
</text>
